Description: Selviana Desktop Environment - Liria file manager
 Liria is the file manager of the Selviana Desktop Environment (SDE),
 written by the Selviana DE Project: it browses folders, the trash,
 removable media and network places (through GIO and GVfs) and opens files
 with their default applications. In SDE the desktop icons are
 sde-desktop's, not Liria's.
 .
 It runs on any X11 desktop; with sde-core it follows the SDE look.

