Description: Selviana Desktop Environment - Xanara PDF viewer and editor
 Xanara is the document viewer and PDF editor of the Selviana Desktop
 Environment (SDE), written from scratch by the Selviana DE Project. It
 shows PDF documents, edits their text, pages, images and annotations with
 its own PDF engine (libqpdf, HarfBuzz, FreeType), fills forms, prints
 through CUPS and recognizes scanned text with Tesseract.
 .
 It runs on any X11 desktop; with sde-core it follows the SDE look.

