Description: Selviana Desktop Environment - Niny text editor
 Niny is the text editor of the Selviana Desktop Environment (SDE), written
 from scratch by the Selviana DE Project: tabs, syntax highlighting, search
 and replace, a Markdown preview, a command palette, encodings and spell
 checking through hunspell or aspell.
 .
 It runs on any X11 desktop; with sde-core it follows the SDE look.

