Description: Selviana Desktop Environment - Taca archive manager
 Taca is the archive manager of the Selviana Desktop Environment (SDE),
 written from scratch by the Selviana DE Project. It opens and extracts zip,
 7z, rar, tar (gz, bz2, xz, zst, lz4), iso, cab, deb, rpm and more through
 libarchive, creates zip, 7z and tar archives with passwords and split
 volumes, and refuses archives that would write outside the target folder.
 7-Zip adds encrypted 7z archives and unrar encrypted RAR archives.
 .
 It runs on any X11 desktop; with sde-core it follows the SDE look.

