 Gallery (command sde-gallery) is the photo library of the Selviana Desktop
 Environment (SDE), written from scratch by the Selviana DE Project: photos
 by date, albums and places, cameras and memory cards, duplicates, a
 slideshow and batch rotation, export and printing. Photos open in Photo
 (sde-photo) for editing.
 .
 It runs on any X11 desktop; with sde-core it follows the SDE look.

